      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.city-usa.top/state-oregon-city-three-rivers"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The arrival of the railroad helped solidify Three Rivers as an important transportation hub in the past.",
