        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.city-usa.top/state-oregon-city-three-rivers"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Three Rivers maintains a relaxed, small-town atmosphere and is located in the heart of Deschutes County.",
